    "narrative": "Jennifer Jean Larson \u2014 a composite read across 2 layers (astrology, human_design).\n\nCelestially, Jennifer Jean Larson carries a Capricorn Sun (cardinal earth): strategic, long-game ambition that engineers outcomes. The Leo Moon colors the inner life with expressive, warm-centered confidence that seeks creative visibility, while a Scorpio Ascendant means others first meet intense, penetrating focus that transforms what it touches. The chart is weighted toward Fire: identity runs on inspiration and momentum. Born under a Waning Gibbous moon, there is a native orientation toward release, distillation, and completion.\n\nIn the Human Design system, Jennifer Jean Larson operates as a Generator \u2014 a sustainable life-force builder. The working strategy is \"To Respond\" with Emotional authority: decisions land best when they respond to what shows up rather than initiating from the mind. The 3/1 profile shapes how learning and purpose interlock. Defined channels (Discovery) mark where this energy is consistent and reliable.",
